From c403f539f7926e39e66a64d5e929af62f7b27e08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:06:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat(tools): tool library import modes - add, update in
 place, replace

ImportTools takes an ImportMode (Add default, unchanged). Update puts a
same-named tool's imported definition in place (entity and controller
number kept, operations go Stale); Replace also removes document tools the
library lacks, refused by name when an operation uses one. One undo unit.
GUI mode combo, cam.importTools / MCP import_tool_library mode parameter.

Fixes #899

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
